  << /ActualText (They expect users to\072\nStop working \222 change context \222 prepare \222 exercise \222 recover \222 return to their day\056\n\nFor someone working 40\053 hours per week\054 the workout itself isn\047t necessarily the only friction\056\n\nA \03420\055minute workout\035 could psychologically represent\072\nPreparation \053 interruption \053 exercise \053 cleanup \053 returning to work\056\n\nThe perceived commitment becomes much larger than 20 minutes\056)
