  << /ActualText (Research Objective\072\n\nUnderstand\072\nWhat happens during a typical 40\053 hour work week\nWhen and why planned exercise gets abandoned\nWhat users consider a workout worth doing\nWhether 5\054 3\054 or even 1 minute feels achievable\nHow meetings\054 deadlines and fatigue affect fitness decisions\nWhether users can realistically leave their desks\nWhich fitness\055app features create additional cognitive load\nWhat causes users to dismiss fitness notifications\nHow comfortable users are with fitness technology\nWhether micro\055workouts and desk exercises can overcome time friction\n\nThe key is to study behavior under pressure\054 not ideal behaviour\056)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 4233 0 R
     /Pg 4206 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
