4336 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Instead of competing with the user\047s workday\072\n\nInsert movement into the gaps that already exist inside it\056\n\nPotential moments include\072\n\n1 minute before a meeting\n3 minutes after a meeting\n2 minutes while waiting for something\n5\055minute lunch break\n60\055second posture reset\nDesk stretch after prolonged sitting\nStanding movement during a call)
     /K [ 65 ]
     /P 4337 0 R
     /Pg 4206 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

