4346 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The enemy isn\047t exercise\056 The enemy is time\056\nI investigated why professionals working 40\053 hour weeks disengage from fitness apps\054 focusing on the behavioural friction created by limited time\054 mental fatigue\054 workplace constraints and traditional workout expectations\056 Rather than designing for ideal fitness routines\054 the goal was to explore micro\055workouts and desk\055based movement for the moments when users cannot leave their desks\056)
     /K [ 70 ]
     /P 4347 0 R
     /Pg 4206 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

4347 0 obj
  << /K [ 4346 0 R ]
     /P 4354 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 4206 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
